Dear RT Folks,

I'm pleased to announce the 3.18.36-rt37 stable release.


This release is just an update to the new stable 3.18.36 version
and no RT specific changes have been made.


You can get this release via the git tree at:

  git://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/rt/linux-stable-rt.git

  branch: v3.18-rt
  Head SHA1: 102f914b209d29682139970bc815e25fbf6a1c94


Or to build 3.18.36-rt37 directly, the following patches should be applied:

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/v3.x/linux-3.18.tar.xz

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/v3.x/patch-3.18.36.xz

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/projects/rt/3.18/patch-3.18.36-rt37.patch.xz




Enjoy,

-- Steve
